confirm.description:
Home Assistant still lists Ampio entities that the Ampio server serves to the administrator login alone. This integration uses a standard Ampio account:

{names}

They come back on their own, with the same entity ids, if you point the integration back at the administrator account. Submit deletes these records from Home Assistant instead. Automations and dashboards that name them stop working. Nothing changes on the Ampio server.

Home Assistant still lists Ampio devices or entities that the Ampio server no longer accounts for:

{names}

Submit to delete these records from Home Assistant. Automations and dashboards that name them stop working. Nothing changes on the Ampio server. After the reload that follows, an object the Ampio server still serves comes back under the module it belongs to now.
